+/*
+ * Aave v3.3+ LiquidationLogic constants and rules.
+ * Source (verified 2026-09-28):
+ *   https://github.com/aave-dao/aave-v3-origin/blob/v3.3.0/src/contracts/protocol/libraries/logic/LiquidationLogic.sol
+ *     (tag v3.3.0 = 5431379f8beb4d7128c84a81ced3917d856efa84, lines 61-82 constants, 278-340 close factor + dust rule)
