+ *   rounds the reserve-debt base value UP (MathUtils.mulDivCeil) where v3.3.0 floors it — we use the ceil form.
+ *
+ *   DEFAULT_LIQUIDATION_CLOSE_FACTOR      = 0.5e4 (50%)
+ *   CLOSE_FACTOR_HF_THRESHOLD             = 0.95e18  ("below (inclusive)" -> 100%)
+ *   MIN_BASE_MAX_CLOSE_FACTOR_THRESHOLD   = 2000e8   (USD base, 8 decimals)
